<title>USA: Central Parking to acquire Civic Parking.</title>
<headline>Central Parking to acquire Civic Parking.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Parking Corp said on Wednesday that it signed a definitive agreement to acquire Civic Parking LLC, which owns four parking garages in St. Louis.</p>
<p>Central Parking said in a release the four garages have a total of 7,464 parking spaces and annual revenue of about $12 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition will financed with a combination of current cash and bank borrowings.</p>
</text>
